API Flow Examples
Complete User Journey
Register (/api/auth/signin)

Login (/api/auth/login)

Browse Events (/api/events)

View Event Details (/api/events/{id})

Enroll in Event (/api/events/{eventId}/enrol)

View Enrollments (/api/users/enrolments)

View Results (/api/events/{eventId}/results)

Organizer Workflow
Login with organizer account

Create Event (/api/events)

Add Categories (/api/events/{eventId}/categories)

View Enrollments (/api/events/{eventId}/enrolments)

Record Results (/api/enrolments/{id}/result)

View Dashboard (/api/dashboard/organiser)
